    "text": "New York\nCanned Cocktails Sold in New York Recalled After Being Put Into Celsius Cans\nBy CJ McIntyre,\n3 hours agoA popular canned cocktail drink has been recalled after some of its vodka seltzer was accidentally put in Celsius energy drinks. High Noon, the company that makes one of the more popular vodka seltzer drinks on the market, has announced that it is recalling two of its products after an apparent labeling mistake.",
